/ActualText (Department of Chemical Engineering,- formed in 2012, is ranked among the nation's top schools in Chemical Engi- neering and is endowed with a highly competitive undergraduate program. The department imparts a fine balance of fundamental knowledge, practical exposure and novel concepts. It has not only achieved excellence in fundamen- tal research but also contributed to the chemical industry through its expertise in process engineering and simulation and modeling. )
