/ActualText (The Department of Electronics & Communication Engineering came into its independent existence in year 1996. The department deals with Analog & Digital Circuit Design, Data Communi- cations & Networking, Wireless and Optical Communication, VLSI and Microcontroller, Embedded system and Robotics coupled with coding and other IT perspectives. VCAS \(one)
/Pg 22 0 R
