/ActualText (Department of Biotechnology was established in 2012 with the objective of integrating life sciences with engineer- ing and to develop cutting-edge tech- nology through research, training and technological innovation. Biosangam \(India's biggest International confer- ence on biotech interventions for socie- tal development\) is organised by Bio- technology Department at MNNIT. The department has undertaken numerous research projects with financial assis- tance from MNRE, DBT, DST etc even during the Covid-19. )
